@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName "WenQuanYi Micro Hei"
left to right direction

node "Linux 主机：可信侧" as Host {
  component "actrail-vsock-gateway" as Gateway
  component "actraild\nGateway ingest + Sandbox plugins" as Daemon
  database "brain-side 主存储\n（不接收 hand-side observation）" as MainDb
  database "Sandbox Evidence DB" as EvidenceDb
  database "Sandbox Alert DB" as AlertDb

  node "VMM 边界" as Vmm {
    node "Guest 沙箱：hand side" as Guest {
      component "actrail-sb" as Sb
      component "hand-side workload" as Workload
    }
  }
}

Workload --> Sb : Guest-local observation
Sb --> Gateway : AF_VSOCK Hand frame
Gateway --> Daemon : TCP Hand frame
Daemon --> EvidenceDb : 无匹配使用方
Daemon --> AlertDb : Sandbox 插件提交 alert
Daemon .. MainDb : brain-side 路径独立

note bottom of Daemon
匹配 observation 进入对应 Sandbox 插件队列；
不转换为 brain-side trace 或身份。
end note
@enduml
